  ('flag_av_access_procedure_l12m', 'flag_av_access_procedure_l12m', 'flag', 'Exclusions and gates', 0, '341,377', NULL, '1 if an AV access procedure for haemodialysis was billed in the last 12 months (Nov 2025 to Oct 2026): fistula or graft creation / revision (CPT 36800-36838), dialysis-circuit procedures (36901-36909), or a dialysis catheter complication (T82.4).'),
